  "persona": "",
  "subject": "a To Kwa Wan neon-sign maker hand-bending glass tubes over a gas flame through the night to finish a four-metre sign for Bing Kee, a noodle shop reopening that evening, down to the twenty-stroke character for noodles, until he flips the switch and Ma Tau Wai Road turns pink",
  "caption": "Cantonese uplifting trance-pop in the classic late-2000s vocal-trance mould. A four-on-the-floor kick with open hi-hats on the off-beats, a rolling off-beat bassline, a bright supersaw lead playing fast 16th-note arpeggios, gated trance pads pulsing under the verses, a long snare-roll build into each chorus and a short breakdown with a plucked piano arp. Wide, airy trance mix with long hall reverb on the supersaw lead and gentle sidechain breathing on the pads. A clear male tenor, breathless and quick in the verses, opening up full-voiced and sustained on the chorus. 138 BPM, G minor. Sleepless, stubborn and euphoric. No hardstyle kick, no big-room drop, no trap hi-hats, no autotune, no rap verse, no slow ballad section.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n凌晨一點 土瓜灣工場\n煤氣火一噴 藍色嘶嘶聲\n玻璃管 燒到軟過一條麵\n含住條膠喉 輕輕吹啖氣\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n炳記今晚七點重開 四米長嘅招牌\n仲差一個麵字 足足二十畫\n\n[Chorus]\n屈 屈 屈 對住張紙樣\n燒紅一吋 屈一吋\n隻手要快過玻璃凍\n天光之前 屈埋佢\n\n[Verse]\n天光 手指焫起兩粒泡\n第十一枝 屈過籠 啪一聲斷\n炳叔打嚟 話唔使咁趕\n我話 你以前一日都冇遲過開門\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n抽真空 灌埋氣 逐枝封好口\n六點 搭好棚 吊出馬頭圍道\n\n[Chorus]\n屈 屈 屈 二十畫屈晒\n燒紅一吋 屈一吋\n隻手要快過玻璃凍\n四米長 終於掛喺半空\n\n[Bridge]\n七點 成條街 企喺對面等\n炳叔 叫我揸住個掣\n三 二 一\n\n[Chorus]\n啪 一聲 成個招牌著\n成條馬頭圍道 粉紅晒\n炳叔喊咗 話同以前一樣\n排隊嗰班人 個個面都粉紅\n\n[Outro]\n返去工場 熄咗個火\n瞓醒 再屈下一個字",
